### strict-limits-and-deadband
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=600
init 0
s 0 30
s 100 30
s 101 30.01
s 131 30.01
s 140 28
s 200 28
s 201 27.99
s 231 27.99
